sequenceDiagram
    participant A as A (central manager)
    participant B as B (central manager)
    participant C as C (peripheral manager)

    Note over C: A and B are both subscribed to C
    C->>C: distance(B) within threshold, role peripheral
    C->>C: send(to B), activeSessionId = B, stopAdvertising, acceptsPeers = false
    C-->>A: notify declined (high priority, onSubscribedCentrals [A])
    C->>C: dropPeer(A)
    C-->>B: encrypted payload (onSubscribedCentrals [B])
    A->>A: handleDecline(C), C not selected, dropPeer(C)
    Note over A: A keeps ranging B
